# Managed by chezmoi. Edit dot_config/yt-dlp/config in the dotfiles repo.
#
# yt-dlp-ejs provides full YouTube support. Use Deno (the recommended runtime)
# and allow yt-dlp to fetch the EJS components from npm when they are not
# already installed with yt-dlp.
--js-runtimes deno
--remote-components ejs:npm

# Skip videos already recorded in archive.txt. The path is relative to the
# current working directory, so each download directory keeps its own archive.
--download-archive ./archive.txt
